  speakerName: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0fcb4f4247841f844a4ed3948dae66cf, type: 2}
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  portugueseText: "Quando parece que as criaturas foram embora, uma delas aparece
    na entrada do beco. Ela olha o beco por um tempo, e no \xFAltimo momento, quando
    parecia n\xE3o ter visto nada, consegue encontrar os dois, e avan\xE7a para atac\xE1-los."
  englishText: Just when it seems the creatures have left, one of them appears at
    the entrance to the alley. It scans the alley for a while, and at the last moment,
    when it seems to have seen nothing, it manages to spot the two and charges towards
    them.
